      <h1>Best 400 GSM Hoodie Manufacturers in China: A Buyer's Guide to Vetting, Sampling &amp; Sourcing</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-07">October 7, 2026</time></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">Search "best 400 GSM hoodie manufacturers in China" and you get a wall of factory lists. Almost none of them explain how to distinguish a mill that genuinely knits 400 gsm fleece from a supplier that ships 320 gsm and calls it "heavyweight." That gap is what this guide closes.</p>
