        <h2 id="framework">The 7-Point Framework for Evaluating 400 GSM Hoodie Manufacturers</h2>

        <p>Run every candidate through all seven dimensions, then weight them against your own priorities. A brand doing 500-piece drops should weight sampling speed and MOQ flexibility heavily. A brand scaling toward 20,000 units should weight knitting capacity and QC consistency instead.</p>

        <figure class="ar-figure">
